                        "entry_id": "eda58f25-f1c2-304f-ad1f-f87b1b91eec4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who snores (or is snoring)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "899dcb8c-f815-4e84-bf80-c5b73b3cde26",
                                "sense_id": "7a118f3a-acf9-3464-9aee-bf44bf045099",
                                "text": "One snorer can keep a whole room of sleepy people awake."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "820c880a-317e-4504-8689-e036f044ef41",
                                "sense_id": "7a118f3a-acf9-3464-9aee-bf44bf045099",
                                "text": "But there, Erskine was not a snorer. And yet to look at him, or hear him sing his song, you would have taken him for a snorer, a great snorer."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
